408
00:33:56,420 --> 00:34:03,420
Researchers, including MIT professor Carolyn Ross, are searching for an alternative, using magnets.

409
00:34:04,420 --> 00:34:10,420
The next big thing that's coming along is called MRAM, that's Magnetic Random Access Memory.

410
00:34:10,421 --> 00:34:14,460
And what that is is a magnetic chip that you can put in your computer,

411
00:34:14,461 --> 00:34:17,700
