00:34:45,801 --> 00:34:50,800
So we pass a big current through some coils and that produces a magnetic field.

420
00:34:50,801 --> 00:34:54,800
And it characterizes the magnetic properties of a material.

421
00:34:54,801 --> 00:34:59,800
So we can assess whether that will be a good material to use in an MRAM or a hard disk

