00:35:38,760 --> 00:35:40,920
Researchers produce the plastic magnets

432
00:35:40,921 --> 00:35:42,260
by mixing two chemicals,

433
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:46,000
vanadium hexacarbonyl and tetracyanoethylene.

434
00:35:47,000 --> 00:35:49,740
What I have here is the vanadium TCME

435
00:35:49,741 --> 00:35:52,780
that's been deposited on a piece of Teflon tape.

436
00:35:53,200 --> 00:35:55,100
The easiest way to tell if it's magnetic or not

437
00:35:55,101 --> 00:35:58,100
is to stick it next to a magnet and see for the tracks.

