00:35:59,900 --> 00:36:04,100
Ohio State's research teams have learned they can manipulate the strength of this magnetism

439
00:36:04,101 --> 00:36:05,780
using surprising new methods.

440
00:36:07,140 --> 00:36:12,860
With plastic magnets, you're able to control magnetism in ways we can control it

441
00:36:12,861 --> 00:36:15,000
with conventional metal or ceramic magnets.

442
00:36:15,520 --> 00:36:19,120
The plastic magnet has a structure we can address with light.

443
00:36:19,121 --> 00:36:28,120
Experimenting with lasers, the researchers have found they can alter the strength of plastic magnets using different colors of light.

444
00:36:28,121 --> 00:36:34,120
Blue light increases the magnet's strength by about 150%.

445
00:36:34,121 --> 00:36:43,120
Green light has the opposite effect. It reduces the magnetism by about 60%.

446
00:36:43,121 --> 00:36:50,120
Such results hold the promise of recording and reading digital information in a revolutionary new way.

