00:38:58,120 --> 00:39:04,560
This is possible because most common materials, including water and living tissue, are weakly magnetic.

471
00:39:05,520 --> 00:39:11,520
They're said to be diamagnetic, meaning they exhibit a subtle tendency to be repulsed by a magnetic field.

472
00:39:13,600 --> 00:39:22,720
One intriguing way to demonstrate this diamagnetic force, as well as the unparalleled power of the lab's magnet, is to enlist the aid of an ordinary frog.

