485
00:40:25,761 --> 00:40:32,720
You can levitate the shaft and allow the shaft to rotate it in a magnetic field.

486
00:40:34,060 --> 00:40:40,660
A racier form of magnetic levitation is scorching its way along a 12-mile test track in Emsland, Germany.

487
00:40:41,800 --> 00:40:51,200
