491
00:41:10,921 --> 00:41:15,880
An electromagnetic field generated in the guideway attracts the magnets, lifting the

492
00:41:15,881 --> 00:41:19,980
train less than half an inch above the track.

493
00:41:19,981 --> 00:41:24,800
A second set of magnets lining the train's sides exerts a lateral force, keeping the

