507
00:42:34,512 --> 00:42:37,640
stop up to 400 to 600 miles an hour.

508
00:42:37,641 --> 00:42:43,520
We have no contact with the ground due to the levitation.

509
00:42:44,320 --> 00:42:50,240
And then the linear motor provides the acceleration and the propulsion in the forward direction.

510
00:42:53,160 --> 00:42:57,620
A magnetic levitation launch system would conserve a huge amount of fuel.

511
